# Playwright visual regression baseline screenshots are stored here.
#
# These PNG files are committed to the repository so CI can compare
# incoming changes against approved baselines.
#
# To update baselines after intentional UI changes:
#   1. Run: npm --prefix tests run test:update-snapshots
#   2. Review the updated PNGs with: npm --prefix tests run test:report
#   3. Commit the changes and open a PR for maintainer review.
#
# In CI the update-baselines job in .github/workflows/visual-regression.yml
# can be triggered manually (workflow_dispatch) to automate this process.
